<title>MOROCCO: Morocco, France sign loan for electricity project.</title>
<headline>Morocco, France sign loan for electricity project.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's National Electricity Office (ONE) and the French Development Chamber (CFD) signed an agreement on Wednesday for a loan to Morocco to provide electricity to rural areas.</p>
<p>The official Moroccan news agency MAP said the 364 million dirhams ($41.4 million) loan will finance part of the first stage of a project to bring electricity to 336 villages in northern and central Morocco.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.8 dirhams)</p>
</text>
